OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GLahav Shani conducts the
OL,6,     GRotterdam Philharmonic in
OL,7,     GBeethoven, there's a Beethoven
OL,8,     Gsonata with pianist Imogen Cooper
OL,9,     Gplus highlights from the RNCM
OL,10,     GInternational Brass Band Festival.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Rachmaninov
OL,12,     GRachmaninov finds himself having
OL,13,     Gto take on the running of the
OL,14,     GIvanovka estate and buys a car to
OL,15,     Gzip around the surrounding
OL,16,     Gcountryside when it all gets a
OL,17,     Gbit much.
OL,18,G1700FIn Tune
OL,19,     GPetroc Trelawny welcomes harpist
OL,20,     GCatrin Finch to 80A. He is also
OL,21,     Gjoined in studio by composer and
OL,22,     Gdouble bassist Bara Gisladottir.
